// [DRAFT] D462 — as soon as Kusakam leaves his cage, Malik walks over first and asks who they are; each names only themselves (D461);
// then Malik names himself and leads on — the malik_escort task is taken without a menu (D305). Formerly Lab_Malik_Quest.
say|MALIK|Hey, you! Still alive? What a racket that was... Who are you?
say|ASTRIT|Astrit. My shield remembers everyone who ever put me behind bars.
say|URIZEN|Urizen, priest of the God of Contracts.
say|ALISIA|Alisia. And this is my cat. Whatever they injected me with burns from the inside... but I'm still standing.
say|KUSAKAM|Kusakam. I'm looking for my family's relic — and the ones who stole it.
say|MALIK|Malik, a humble merchant. Get me out of here, and at my humble place every one of you gets gold. Lots of gold.
say|MALIK|Alright — come with me!
exit|
